Accordingly, an Underlying Fund with positive performance may be entitled to
receive a performance allocation or fee from the Fund, and thus indirectly from
Members, even if the Fund's overall investment return is negative.

TAX CONSIDERATIONS AND DELAYED TAX REPORTING. The tax aspects of an investment
