PORTFOLIO TURNOVER. The Underlying Funds should be expected to have higher
portfolio turnover than many other investment funds. The brokerage commissions
and other transaction costs incurred by the Underlying Funds will be generally
higher than those incurred by investment funds with lower portfolio turnover
